  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Question
  questionText: Anything strange you notice out on the streets?
  largeQuestionBox: 0
  conversation:
  - <i>Ooo</i>, good angle. Good angle.
  - "Let\u2019s see... <i>well</i>, here\u2019s a little oddity for you. Might not
    be related, but I know the nature of these kinds of mysteries."
  - How these little bits and pieces end up slotting into the puzzle in ways you
    can never see coming.
  - <color=notiCol>At 9pm on the dot, every Saturday, including <i>last night</i>,
    someone sets off fireworks over the lake</color>. No clue who. No clue how they
    keep getting away with it.
  - "Sometimes I forget, and it starts up when I\u2019m already looking out over
    the lake. Scares the shit out of me."
